Version 1.0 is a rewrite of the 0.1.x releases. The post-processor, report generation, GeoJSON mapping and
confidence-report code were carried forward from them.

Model bundles distributed for this package are trained on NREL ResStock data
(End-Use Load Profiles for the U.S. Building Stock, resstock_tmy3_release_2, 2024), licensed CC-BY-4.0.

The packaged Census tract table (src/usg/resources/location/county_puma_tracts.npz) is derived from public-domain
U.S. Census Bureau files: 2010 Census tract centers of population and the 2010 Census tract to 2010 PUMA
relationship file.
